      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "The declared abstraction replaces EA and its syntax with an arbitrary classical base and sentence type. In particular, F is any sentence function, not necessarily application of a single one-free-variable arithmetic formula to sentence numerals. The target does not express arithmetic definability, Gödel coding, or the distinction between Σ⁰₁ and more complex formulas."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "The target fixes Con(F) to mean ∼F ⊥, whereas the passage uses Con(F) without specifying its expansion there."
    },
