      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Def1, Def2, and Def4 make knowledge of the base, closure of knowledge under modus ponens, and known factivity explicit hypotheses on the abstract K. The quoted theorem does not list these as separate hypotheses."
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The pointwise capture hypothesis and the nesting of K and negation in the conclusion match the passage under the stated reading of Con(F). The target nevertheless omits theory inclusion and assumes an additional base-provable implication about F, so it is not the theorem as printed."
